<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>MOTD</title>

<style>
body {
    background: #121212;
    color: #cccccc;
    font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
}

/* Server Title */
.server-title {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4da6ff;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* Section styling */
.section {
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    background: #1f1f1f;
}

.section-title {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4da6ff;
    padding: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
}

.section-content {
    padding: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #e0e0e0;
}

/* Banner image */
.banner img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
}

/* Subtitle style (description) */
.subtitle {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: normal;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="server-title">
WELCOME TO OUR SERVER ABOUT THE SOVIET METRO
</div>

<div class="subtitle"></div>

<!-- Banner -->
<div class="section banner">
    <div class="section-title">Banner</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        <img src="https://i.imgur.com/NytDfPc.jpeg">
    </div>
</div>

<!-- About -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">About This Server</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        This server represents realistic metro lines of the soviet metro.<br>
        This server is for drivers with a professional league.<br>
        We're using realistic sounds of Ruble Metrostroi (v. 2.0.0).
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Rules -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Rules</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        1. Don't attack other players for fun.<br>
        2. Spawn at most one train within 30 seconds.<br>
        3. Do not disturb drivers.<br>
        4. No collisions with other drivers.<br>
        5. No swear words over loudspeaker.
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Reporting -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Reporting Rulebreakers</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        • Contact an available admin on the server.<br>
        • Use @ in chat to contact admins.<br>
        • If no admin is online, note name + time.
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Addons -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Installed Addons</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        (Automatically handled by server)
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Admins -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Our Admins</div>
    <div class="section-content">
        superadmin<br>
        admin
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
